stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> running: 派工开跑
  running --> ship_parked: 节点完工(Fix 1 改为停驻)
  ship_parked --> running: QA FAIL / founder 返工唤醒
  ship_parked --> completed: run 收尾(ship finalization)结清
  completed --> [*]: 座位回收
  note right of ship_parked
    停驻 = 账面与身体一致:
    工人进程活着、邮箱在听,
    park 台账留有停驻凭证
  end note
